codex
A material edge case emerged: `dscore == +/-1` is not always “two fresh votes minus lagging MACD.” It can also be a single nonzero vote with the other two sources absent/neutral, and the current confidence formula gives a single nonzero vote high agreement. That means some promoted single-vote states can pass `require_tape_direction_min_conf=0.5/0.6`.
